<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-AMD price target lifted.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-AMD price target lifted.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securites analyst Mark Edelstone confirmed that he reiterated the brokerage's buy rating on Advanced Micro Devices Inc and raised its 12 month price target to $90 a share from $40 a share.</p>
<p>-- Edelstone said he raised the price target based on his 1998 EPS estimate of $5.25.</p>
</text>
